# T10.7: Doom II MAP20 played as Final Doom's first executable (gameversion
# final): started beside the WR teleport line 355 (special 97, tag 8; its
# front floor 72), the player walks across it to the destination, whose
# floor is 248: EV_Teleport leaves the player's height as it was
# (exe_final), so it arrives 176 units under the floor, and
# P_ZMovement lifts it with the smooth step up (its view height then
# recovers through P_CalcHeight); the destination fog spawns at the old
# height. Then waits. Written by tools/RouteGen (map20-line355), the wait
# lengthened.
gameversion final
iwad doom2
map MAP20
start 3808 480 90

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0
25 0 0 0 x10
0 0 0 0 x60
